From 41dce11c77a90aed38dd32f304c6cc8b0a254674 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: CarlosDLMC <delamorenacoco.carlos@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 20:25:26 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] feat: rotate the image a quarter turn left or right

Toolbar buttons and Ctrl-R / Ctrl-Shift-R. The annotations are baked
into the image, which is turned and refitted; the crop follows. Undo
and redo restore the image and its annotations.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
